{"id":11597,"mal_id":11597,"title":"Nisemonogatari","englishTitle":"Nisemonogatari","title_english":"Nisemonogatari","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Impostory"],"en":"Nisemonogatari","ja":"偽物語"},"synopsis":"Koyomi Araragi has recently survived a vampire attack and met several girls plagued by supernatural entities. On top of all this, he wakes up one morning to find himself kidnapped and tied up by his girlfriend Hitagi Senjougahara. Araragi's sister Karen has run afoul of Deishuu Kaiki, a swindler who once conned Senjougahara's family. As a result, Senjougahara has imprisoned Araragi to keep him safe from the devious Kaiki. But when Araragi receives a frantic message from Karen, he sets out to rescue her.\n\nAlong with Karen's troubles, Tsukihi, Araragi's other sister, faces issues of her own. And when two mysterious women step into their lives, not even Araragi can anticipate their true goals, nor the catastrophic truths about his family soon to be revealed.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Koyomi Araragi sobrevivió recientemente a un ataque de vampiros y conoció a varias chicas plagadas de entidades sobrenaturales. Además de todo esto, una mañana se despierta y se encuentra secuestrado y atado por su novia Hitagi Senjougahara. La hermana de Araragi, Karen, se ha topado con Deishuu Kaiki, un estafador que una vez estafó a la familia de Senjougahara. Como resultado, Senjougahara ha encarcelado a Araragi para mantenerlo a salvo del tortuoso Kaiki. Pero cuando Araragi recibe un mensaje frenético de Karen, se propone rescatarla.\n\nAdemás de los problemas de Karen, Tsukihi, la otra hermana de Araragi, enfrenta sus propios problemas. Y cuando dos mujeres misteriosas entran en sus vidas, ni siquiera Araragi puede anticipar sus verdaderos objetivos, ni las catastróficas verdades sobre su familia que pronto serán reveladas.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1555,"average_epi